DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, October 24\, 2026\, two of the Bay Area’s most
  impactful college access events — the UC Berkeley Showcase and College 
 Information Day — are coming together for the second time to launch a po
 werful experience: College Information Day at UC Berkeley. Co-hosted by UC
  Berkeley and the East Bay Consortium\, this fall open house invites middl
 e school\, high school\, and college transfer students\, their families\, 
 counselors\, and community partners to campus for a comprehensive and insp
 iring introduction to college planning\, admissions\, and student life. To
 gether\, we aim to equip students with the information\, support\, and ins
 piration they need to confidently pursue higher education.\nCategory: Acad
 emic\nOriginal listing: https://events.berkeley.edu/featured/event/327694-
 college-information-day-uc-berkeley-showcase
