DESCRIPTION:Two America’s at 250: an art exhibit on our country’s true
  working class history. We are in the battle for history as the U.S. marks
  250 years since its founding. The ruling class has always whitewashed the
  country’s true history\, but this is taking on a new face under the Tru
 mp administration as it is actively reshaping how American history is pres
 ented in federal institutions\, public landmarks\, and schools. As Trump w
 orks to implement his racist\, pro-billionaire agenda\, he is using histor
 y as a weapon. He wants us to find pride in a history of bigotry and explo
 itation because he and his movement are the modern continuation of that hi
 story. Instead\, we have to draw inspiration from our real\nCategory: Book
 s\nOriginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/two-americas-at-250-an-
 art-exhibit-of-our-countrys-true-working-class-history/
