DESCRIPTION:Colorful Youth is the only film with a contemporary setting st
 arring both Connie Chan Po-chu and Josephine Siao Fong-fong\, unequivocall
 y the most popular teen idols in the history of Cantonese cinema. Choreogr
 aphed song-and-dance numbers and swimsuit parties punctuate the story\, pe
 rformed by beautiful young men and women in the trendiest fashions. Not wi
 thout a moral center\, the bedazzled youth also encounter setbacks\, unsav
 ory characters\, and dark gang entanglements. Through this complex tapestr
 y of experiences and upheavals\, they learn to rebuild their lives\, makin
 g their colorful youth worthwhile.\nCategory: Films\nOriginal listing: htt
 ps://events.berkeley.edu/BAMPFA/event/328125-film-screening-colorful-youth
