 tates
DESCRIPTION:2026 Guarnaschelli Lecture Series Criticism and the Theatrical
  Ecology A conversation with Helen Shaw\, Chief Theatre Critic for The New
  York Times Criticism and the Theatrical Ecology brings together The New Y
 ork Times Chief Theatre Critic Helen Shaw and Professor of Theatre Arts an
 d Performance Studies Patricia Ybarra for a wide-ranging conversation abou
 t theatre today. Shaw will discuss the state of contemporary theatre\, fro
 m emerging trends in New York and international theatre to how people are 
 creating work amid shifting financial and political realities. She will re
 flect on the role critics play within the contemporary theatrical ecology
 \, as well as how we might encourage young artists\nCategory: Conferences 
 and Colloquia\nOriginal listing: https://events.brown.edu/live/events/3400
 45-guarnaschelli-lecture-series-a-conversation-with
