SUMMARY:Exhibition on View | Building Books with Dayanita Singh — Provid
 ence
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-04:00":20261027T000000
DTSTAMP:20261025T162751Z
UID:78dd40b1905a3d722a9b2662fbb8@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\, Open to the Public\,Providence\,United States
DESCRIPTION:In her practice\, Dayanita Singh experiments with form through
  photography\, architecture\, and books to create exhibitions. Using these
  mediums\, Singh extends an invitation to audiences to question how books
 \, and book-making\, might transform a space into an exhibition. This show
  takes cues from Singh’s artist-led approach to exhibitions to explore t
 he relationship between “making” and “reading.” With Singh’s Boo
 k Building (2022) as a blueprint\, this exhibition analyzes book-making as
  an artistic practice\, material form\, and conceptual process. Works in t
 he exhibition span Singh’s career\, including Book Building (2022)\, Blu
 e Book (2009)\, File Room (2013)\, Museum of Chance (2014)\, and Sent a Le
 t\nCategory:  Open to the Public\nOriginal listing: https://events.brown.e
 du/bai/event/338354-exhibition-on-view-building-books-with-dayanita-singh
LOCATION:Granoff Center for the Creative Arts\, Granoff Center for the Cre
 ative Arts
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://events.brown.edu/bai/event/338354-exhibition-on-view-building-
 books-with-dayanita-singh
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:brown-arts
END:VEVENT
