DTSTAMP:20261025T162751Z
UID:992ec34aa57daa004800cba02648@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Art + Design\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Join us for MAKE @ MODA: Handmade Altars\, a hands-on workshop
  exploring the art and design of altars. Altars have been part of art and 
 design across cultures for centuries. People have used them to honor other
 s\, preserve memories\, express beliefs\, and tell stories. Their design o
 ften brings together meaningful objects and imagery to create a space with
  purpose. During the workshop\, you’ll design and build your own small h
 andmade altar. We’ll explore how color\, symbolism\, composition\, and l
 ayering can help communicate an idea. You’ll work with paper\, collage m
 aterials\, flowers\, found objects\, and decorative elements to bring your
  design to life.\nCategory: Art + Design\nOriginal listing: https://www.ar
 tsatl.org/event/make-moda-handmade-altars/
LOCATION:Museum of Design Atlanta (MODA)\, 1315 Peachtree St. NE\, Atlanta
 \, GA\, 30309
