UID:ade7e81b30f12d55b5fc3f5bc91b@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Art + Design\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Set out as an explorer into a world only you can chart. Enchan
 ted Map of Me is a guided art and self-discovery workshop that invites you
  to follow the contours of your inner life: the experiences that shaped yo
 u\, the values that guide you\, and the hopes still taking form. Through r
 eflection\, drawing\, painting\, symbolism\, and storytelling\, you’ll g
 ive this landscape shape on paper\, discovering its connections and leavin
 g room for what remains unknown. There is no prescribed route or perfect m
 ap to make. The journey is the heart of the experience—time to wander\, 
 notice\, and meet yourself with curiosity. You’ll leave with a map that 
 is yours to keep and a new way of seeing the world you carry w\nCategory: 
 Art + Design\nOriginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/the-enchante
 d-map-of-me-experience/
LOCATION:CreateATL\, 900 Murphy Avenue SW\, Atlanta\, GA\, 30310
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.artsatl.org/event/the-enchanted-map-of-me-experience/
