DESCRIPTION:Spalding Nix Fine Art is pleased to announce A FINE LINE\, a p
 resentation of four shows by Kate Hooray Osmond\, Nancy Talero\, Shannon D
 avis and Laura Dargan on view January 24 – March 20. Charleston-based in
 terdisciplinary Artist Kate Hooray Osmond’s “Americana” explores her
  evolving relationship with the shifting landscape of America through vibr
 ant and expressive genre scene paintings. Atlanta-based Artist Nancy Taler
 o’s “Super Nature” is a series of geometric modular paintings explor
 ing the merging and blurred boundaries of the natural and supernatural wor
