DESCRIPTION:Attend In-Person Attend Online Please join the Middle East Pol
 icy Forum\, in partnership with the Sigur Center for Asian Studies\, on No
 vember 3 to welcome Mohammed Soliman \, author of West Asia: A New America
 n Grand Strategy in the Middle East .  Dr. Alyssa Ayres\, Dean of the Ell
 iott School of International Affairs\, will deliver opening remarks. Moham
 med Soliman argues in his book that it is time for the United States to mo
 ve decisively away from nation-building and get back to the business of or
 der-building. To do so will require zooming out\, in both geographical and
  historical terms\, to build a new regional order across ‘West Asia’ 
 – from the Middle East to South Asia\, connecting Europe to \nCategory: 
