DTSTAMP:20261025T162751Z
UID:7d46cdc3c5aa2dfbadad14f1c142@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Art + Design\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Join MODA for a virtual studio and build a game where players 
 explore ancient ruins. In this virtual studio\, young designers will learn
  how to create an interactive adventure using Scratch. Students will desig
 n an ancient temple\, forgotten city\, or mysterious ruin filled with hidd
 en passages\, puzzles\, treasures\, and discoveries. Using block based cod
 ing\, they will create movement\, interactive objects\, simple puzzles\, a
 nd collectible artifacts as players explore their environment. At the end 
 of the studio\, students can share their work and receive feedback in a su
 pportive environment.\nCategory: Art + Design\nOriginal listing: https://w
 ww.artsatl.org/event/game-design-studio-lost-expedition/
LOCATION:Peachtree Branch Library\, 1315 Peachtree St NE\, Atlanta\, 30309
